{"4192030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Core", "steam_appid": 4192030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Core</strong> is an action platformer in which you control <strong>ROB</strong>, a robot created by a group of rebels with the goal of destroying the Tower that’s draining the planet’s life. You’ll have to fight your way through enemies to advance and reach the top, encountering Bosses along the way who are far more powerful than the rest, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powerful fists to take down enemies and your dash to tackle and dodge your opponents. Remember that your abilities consume energy— it will recharge over time, but if you run out completely, you’ll be left defenseless. However, you can fully recover it along with your health by collecting the crystals scattered throughout the level. Survive until you find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your enemies: the grounded maintenance bots and the flying hunters scattered across the levels. Turn them into scrap.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192030/extras/eternal_core_menú_2?t=1769463229\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Core</strong> is an action platformer in which you control <strong>ROB</strong>, a robot created by a group of rebels with the goal of destroying the Tower that’s draining the planet’s life. You’ll have to fight your way through enemies to advance and reach the top, encountering Bosses along the way who are far more powerful than the rest, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powerful fists to take down enemies and your dash to tackle and dodge your opponents. Remember that your abilities consume energy— it will recharge over time, but if you run out co